This is a simple problem. Sum all salaries, subtract min and max, divide by (count - 2).

Let me write the PHP solution:

```php
class Solution {

    /**
     * @param Integer[] $salary
     * @return Float
     */
    function average($salary) {
        $sum = array_sum($salary);
        $min = min($salary);
        $max = max($salary);
        return ($sum - $min - $max) / (count($salary) - 2);
    }
}
```

That's it. Simple and correct.

