3. `maxF * freqCount[maxF] == len - 1` — all values share frequency `maxF` except one value appearing once; remove that value.
4. `freqCount[maxF] == 1 && (maxF - 1) * distinct == len - 1` — one value has frequency `maxF`, all others have `maxF - 1`; remove one occurrence of the max-frequency value.

