PHP priority queue: use SplPriorityQueue. Note SplPriorityQueue pops the highest priority first, so use negative cost as priority. Also, SplPriorityQueue with equal priorities — order may not be stable but that's fine for Dijkstra.

Also need to handle multiple edges between same nodes — adjacency list with all edges is fine.

