Classic approach: memoized recursion. From n, the optimal strategy is to either:
- Reduce n to nearest multiple of 2 by eating 1s, then eat n/2: cost = n % 2 + 1 + f(n/2)
- Reduce n to nearest multiple of 3 by eating 1s, then eat 2n/3: cost = n % 3 + 1 + f(n/3)

