Classic approach: put all points in a hash set. For each pair of points (p1, p2) that could be diagonal corners (x1 != x2 and y1 != y2), check if (x1, y2) and (x2, y1) exist in the set. If so, compute area = |x1-x2| * |y1-y2| and track minimum.

