1. **Approach**: BFS level-by-level from `beginWord`. Each BFS level represents one more word in the transformation sequence.
2. **Key optimization**: Instead of comparing each word pair (O(N²·L)), for each word generate all possible single-letter mutations (26 letters × L positions) and check membership in a hash set (O(1) via `array_flip`).
3. **Details**:
